  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangent drawn to the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> intersect the co-ordinates axes at the distinct points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, then the locus of the midpoint of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is :"
  },
